{
  "_": [
    "Design sweep 6, the mobile half: the bottom sheets that became",
    "showHollowSheet (one surface, one radius, one drag handle).",
    "",
    "One peer creates a throwaway server, opens the server sheet and a channel",
    "sheet from the chats tab, then sends itself a note in Saved messages and",
    "opens the message actions sheet on it. Shot on the unswept commit first,",
    "then with the sweep applied, and stacked.",
    "",
    "Traps: after dismissing a sheet wait for its barrier to go before the next",
    "tap; the composer's send button has no semantics label here, so it is",
    "tapped by position (402x874 logical).",
    "The channel list expands on a tap but loads `general` late and a tap can land mid-toggle, so the channel sheet steps are soft; the sheet shares showHollowSheet with the other two.",
    "",
    "",
    "run (on the Mac mini): pwsh scripts/fleet.ps1 -Scenario design_sweep6_mobile -Peers a"
  ],
  "peers": [
    "a"
  ],
